<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Nov broad money M3 up 21.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Nov broad money M3 up 21.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's broad money M3 expanded by 21.7 percent year-on-year in November against 22.6 percent growth in October, the central bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Total annual loans growth stood at 28.9 percent at the end of November from 27.6 percent at the end of October, it said in a statement.  </p>
<p>		   MALAYSIA MONETARY AGGREGATES:</p>
<p>(Percentage change at end of period, year-on-year)</p>
<p>	     Nov 96	 Oct 96     Nov 95</p>
<p>  M1	  16.5	   17.1	 11.8</p>
<p>  M2	  19.3	   22.3	 23.5</p>
<p>  M3	  21.7	   22.6	 20.9</p>
<p>Note: M1 - money in circulation and cash on deposit in banks</p>
<p>	 M2 - M1 plus time, savings and foreign currency deposits</p>
<p>	 M3 - broad money</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
